# Progmasoft Core C Coding Guidelines, Tooling (progmasoft-cpp, 2026-11-15).
---
Checks: >-
  -*,
  clang-analyzer-core.*,
  clang-analyzer-deadcode.*,
  clang-analyzer-unix.Malloc,
  bugprone-macro-repeated-side-effects,
  bugprone-sizeof-expression,
  bugprone-suspicious-memset-usage
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*'
FormatStyle: file
SystemHeaders: false
...
